uid><pubDate>2026-10-12T15:35:53+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Ayush Pandey</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134889359,imgsize-77738.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[SC permits Congress delegation to file petition within premises as Rahul leads INDIA bloc march]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-permits-congress-delegation-to-file-petition-within-premises-as-rahul-leads-india-bloc-march/articleshow/134888928.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134888928.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Congress MP called for the "Challo Dilli" protest march, which was planned from Connaught Place to the Supreme Court against the functioning of the poll body. The protest will continue despite the CJI not giving his assent to a meeting with the opposition MPs on the issue. He also emphasised that any citizen or elected representative could approach the court and seek legal relief.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-permits-congress-delegation-to-file-petition-within-premises-as-rahul-leads-india-bloc-march/articleshow/134888928.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/sc-permits-congress-delegation-to-file-petition-within-premises-as-rahul-leads-india-bloc-march/articleshow/134888928.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T15:35:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rajeev Singh</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134889290,imgsize-90842.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Don't pick up words like this': SC says neither approved nor disapproved new Form 6, to examine its validity]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-pick-up-words-like-this-sc-says-neither-approved-nor-disapproved-new-form-6-to-examine-its-validity/articleshow/134888705.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134888705.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[The Supreme Court addressed the controversy surrounding the new Form 6 used for voter registration. It clarified that it had not approved changes to the declaration regarding electoral rolls. The court's remarks arose during a hearing on the functioning of the Election Commission of India. Concerns were raised over the legality of the changes introduced in Form 6. The Supreme Court will further examine this issue in October.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-pick-up-words-like-this-sc-says-neither-approved-nor-disapproved-new-form-6-to-examine-its-validity/articleshow/134888705.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/dont-pick-up-words-like-this-sc-says-neither-approved-nor-disapproved-new-form-6-to-examine-its-validity/articleshow/134888705.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T15:21:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pallavi</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134888989,imgsize-108250.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Why CJI declined to meet Rahul Gandhi, Kharge amid protests against Gyanesh Kumar]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-cji-declined-to-meet-rahul-gandhi-kharge-amid-protests-against-gyanesh-kumar/articleshow/134888026.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134888026.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/why-cji-declined-to-meet-rahul-gandhi-kharge-amid-protests-against-gyanesh-kumar/articleshow/134888026.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https:/