how-india-travels-a-tale-of-two-wheels-and-many-divides/articleshow/134886236.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134886236.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[India's commuting landscape shows noticeable variations influenced by geography, gender, and age demographics. Two-wheelers remain popular, but there's an increasing reliance on buses and walking in certain regions. For students, biking and bus usage is higher in urban areas compared to rural settings. Gender disparity persists, with more male workers using two-wheelers while women predominantly walk or take buses.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/how-india-travels-a-tale-of-two-wheels-and-many-divides/articleshow/134886236.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/how-india-travels-a-tale-of-two-wheels-and-many-divides/articleshow/134886236.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-12T13:32:33+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Arghya Prasun Roychowdhury</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-134886236,imgsize-511082.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Delhi protests: SC on Tuesday to hear pleas on attacks on protesters, lawyers]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/delhi-protests-sc-on-tuesday-to-hear-pleas-on-attacks-on-protesters-lawyers/articleshow/134886301.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/134886301.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/delhi-protests-sc-on-tuesday-to-hear-pleas-on-attacks-on-protesters-lawyers/articleshow/134886301.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/delhi-protests-sc-on-tuesday-to-hear-pleas-on-attacks-on-protesters-